;Test script for "Comptest.exe". Behavior of Fixup WRT calculus

Passthru    <h3>Integrals with various differential markups</h3>
Test ID     213.3
Client ID   1
Engine      MuPAD
Command ID	Fixup
   <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
     <mo largeop="true">&Int;</mo>
     <mo>(</mo>
       <mi>y</mi>
       <mo>+</mo>
       <mi mathcolor="gray">sin</mi>
       <mi>x</mi>
     <mo>)</mo>
     <mo>&dd;</mo>
     <mi>x</mi>
     <mo>&dd;</mo>
     <mi>y</mi>
   </math>
End of test

Test ID     213.3e
Client ID   1
Engine      MuPAD
Command ID	Evaluate
  <math>%</math>
End of test

